## 1. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

### 1.1 Architecture Overview

ExamAI is a cloud-native, microservices-oriented SaaS platform deployed on Kubernetes. It processes Hebrew handwritten exams through a multi-stage AI pipeline, provides real-time teacher review workflows, and scales elastically under load.

**Core Architectural Principles:**
- Bounded context isolation via Domain-Driven Design
- Event-driven async communication via RabbitMQ
- CQRS for read/write separation on high-traffic paths
- Defense-in-depth for security (layered)
- Eventual consistency for async OCR/grading pipelines
- Hexagonal (Ports & Adapters) architecture per service

